		(property "Description" "MCP23017 at I2C address 0x20, 400 kHz. Use GPB0 through GPB6 and GPA0 as control inputs. AUTO key on GPA0. GPB7 drives START CMD and GPA7 drives STOP CMD. Clear both output latches before configuring these pins as outputs. Disable pull-ups on both key inputs. HOST_N and LOCAL_N read the seated transfer plug through separate isolated-side position contacts."
